    administratorLoginPassword: '[REDACTED]'

    location: 'northeurope'
    tags: {
      myTag: 'myValue'
    }
  }
}
```

Here, `ssfog001` is my primary server and `ssfog001-fo` is my secondary server for the failover.

Resources are created just fine:

<img width="518" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54a3544f-ceff-4d16-883a-c6b7f39155ee" />

The primary server has the tags as specified:

<img width="707" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06438cf3-8a2e-41dd-add2-1a9446a0464c" />

The database in the primary server inherited its tags:

<img width="707" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf269d93-63b2-442a-a5af-17a622a2d4cc" />

Secondary (failover) server has the tag as specified:

<img width="707" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/456f42bf-c70f-4dbd-8358-cd9780fbc425" />

